    "title": "Love Deluxe",
    "description": "1992 studio album by Sade",
    "extract": "Love Deluxe is the fourth studio album by English band Sade, released by Epic Records in October 1992 in the United Kingdom and November 1992 in the United States. It differs from Sade's previous three albums by using modernised recording and production techniques. Love Deluxe features a \"lush\" aesthetic and lyrics about the complexities of love and loss.",
